# The scientist at the console by the office (scene 0's object 1): walking
# into the office (zone 0) makes him turn round and cry "A prisoner has
# escaped!" (MESSAGE 5, offset 19, then END_COMPORTEMENT at 22). Hooked
# there (zoe_prison.txt): Zoe in the scientist's coat (body 4) gets a word
# about the patient instead.

== life
  IF BODY_OBJ(0) == 4 else @alarm
  MESSAGE "Ah, the new lab assistant! The prisoner in the cells keeps raving about his dreams. Go and run some tests on him, would you?"
  SET_DIR 0
  ELSE 22
alarm:
  MESSAGE 5
  ELSE 22
